    "title": "El Pollo Loco - Loco Rewards",
    "description": "I hate free food (said no one, ever). Join the Familia to enjoy personalized offers, birthday rewards, and exclusive access to content, experiences, and new menu items at El Pollo Loco. With the app, you'll earn points with every qualified food and beverage purchase to redeem for free food - all while climbing up our Loco Tiers. Start as a Pollito and work your way up to a Pollo Loco!\r\n\r\nUse the El Pollo Loco app to conveniently order from the menu, save your favorites, pay in advance, request delivery, order catering, view tier status, and earn and redeem points for free food. Place an online order and either skip the line when you pick up, or order delivery direct to your door.",
